Package: distDECA
Type: Package
Title: The DECA Distribution: Construction, Simulation and Validation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Karina", "Manya", role = c("aut")),
    person("Angie", "Garzon", role = c("aut")),
    person("Deisy", "Urquizo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "daysi.urquizo@espoch.edu.ec"),
    person("Christian", "Herrera", role = c("aut")))
Description: Implements the continuous DECA distribution on [0,1], with
    density f(x) = 2x exp(x^2)/(e - 1): density, cumulative distribution
    function, random generation by the inverse transform method and a
    chi-square goodness-of-fit test.
